IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0019.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0019C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-FEE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
2000-FEE-WAIVER.
    IF ACCOUNT-GOLD-OR-PREMIUM OR CU-MEAN-BAL >= 1500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
        MOVE 0.00 TO MTH-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 12 TO MTH-FEE
    END-IF.
